			"notes": "1.9\nAdded the ability to export image data!\nWith this feature you can copy the order and colors of the image you are drawing to later use in my other project miniking1000/drawler_timelapser to create a timelaps of drawing without recording everything else.\n\nAdded 'smart' suggestions to map id, from the hand, map you are holding, and the one you are looking at.\nAdded 2 new buttons to dev category to toggle backcheck and export. With export button if you press it to TRUE, then next time you will type /drawpic in chat you will automatically copy necessary data to create a timelaps using my other program miniking1000/drawler_timelapser\nAdded backcheck feature, with this on (it's controlled by dev button) mod will try to find the missing item and not just pause everything entirely, useful with high ping, when minecraft may skip some data about items moving etc.\nFixed translations a bit."
		},
