			"notes": "1.8\nNow Items are highlighted not only in chests and barrels, but also in shulkers.\nAdded sounds, that are played when you finish drawing, or when you don't have necessary item(s) to continue drawing.\nNow there are 3 packs of sounds available: \n1) default - with normal sounds\n2) discord - with sounds from discord\n3) loud - with loud sounds\nYou can disable sounds by turning them off in config, in there you can also swap presets of sounds."
